<link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/10/webai-releases-twil-lm-a-1-7b-and-3b-formal-logic-model-family-for-autoformalization-on-local-hardware/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.marktechpost.com/?p=81661</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 06:20:09 +0000</pubDate>
<source>marktechpost.com</source>
<description><![CDATA[【marktechpost.com】webAI已发布TwIL-LM，这是一个参数规模为1.7B和3B的形式逻辑模型家族，能将英语翻译成一阶逻辑，并检查结论是否由前提推导得出。3B版本可在CPU或4GB显存上运行；1.7B版本下载大小为1.06GB。两者均以非商业许可发布。模型卡片还显示，标题中的基准分数属于一个未发布的检查点，而非Hub上的权重。文章《webAI Releases TwIL-LM: A 1.7B and 3B Formal-Logic Model Family for Autoformalization on Local Hardware》最初出现在MarkTechPost上。<br/><br/><a href="https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/08/10/webai-releases-twil-lm-a-1-7b-and-3b-formal-logic-model-family-for-autoformalization-on-local-hardware/">阅读原文</a>]]></description>
</item>
